# Butler Routes - Badlands completionist (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# Every Badlands accept in the local census (35 quests, docs/badlands-census.md)
# appears exactly once as an accept and once as a turnin. The 35 Horde-accept
# quests stay with the Horde block's census; 1 repeatable (Seal of the Earth),
# 1 spawnless record (the Platinum Discs), 3 above-band records (Ribbly, the
# two Kibler pets) and 2 broken records (Supplies and Studies, Mirage Mirror)
# are out with reasons in the census. No race header and no class gates:
# nothing contracted is race- or class-locked. Writ and crafted-piece lines
# ride optional goals with honest bag notes (the data carries no skill fields
# for them, so no invented when-gates). Item- and object-started quests never
# wedge (note at the source; honest bag notes where the data holds no source).
# Accepts whose pres sit outside every pack contract ride dedicated
# `when onquest` mini-steps, each standing alone. Expedition legs and
# turn-ins (Arathi, Ironforge, Loch Modan, Thousand Needles) switch frames
# deliberately and switch back.
guide butler-routes-completionist/badlands
title Badlands - Completionist
levels 28-40
zone Badlands
category Leveling
folder Completionist
coords live
version 1

step Loch Modan border - Dorgaron's Safety Checks

  zone map 1418

  tip Dorgaron (54.63, 12.87) works the Loch Modan border in the north; the Shadowforge dig site (43.80, 10.60) sits north-west of him.
  accept 97617 only Alliance -- Safety Checks - Dorgaron; artifacts and relics, north
  complete 97617 only Alliance @43.80,10.60 era -- Unstudied Artifacts off the Shadowforge surveyors and diggers, north
  note The Explorers' League Mining Helmet and the Pristine Mattock have no placed source in the data (their objects are not in the dumps) - bank them if they turn up; the artifacts farm here.
  turnin 97617 only Alliance -- Safety Checks - the finds back to Dorgaron
  note The Craftsman's Writ: Steel Plate Helm (94268) starts from a writ item with no placed source - have it in your bags; Furious Shadowforge Digger (44.29, 11.42) takes it, at 60.
  accept 94268 optional -- Craftsman's Writ: Steel Plate Helm - the writ; the helm to the digger, at 60
  turnin 94268 optional -- Craftsman's Writ: Steel Plate Helm - the helm to Furious Shadowforge Digger

step West camp - Studies and Coolant begin

  zone map 1418

  tip Lotwil Veriatus (25.95, 44.87) and Lucien Tosselwrench (25.82, 44.24) run the western camp; the lesser elementals work (13.14, 39.20) south-west and the Rock Elementals (11.98, 34.27) west.
  accept 710 -- Study of the Elements: Rock - Lotwil Veriatus; small shards, south-west
  complete 710 @13.14,39.20 era -- Small Stone Shards off the Lesser Rock Elementals, south-west
  turnin 710 -- Study of the Elements: Rock - the shards to Lotwil Veriatus
  accept 711 -- Study of the Elements: Rock - Lotwil Veriatus; large slabs, west
  complete 711 @11.98,34.27 era -- Large Stone Slabs off the Rock Elementals, west
  turnin 711 -- Study of the Elements: Rock - the slabs to Lotwil Veriatus
  accept 712 -- Study of the Elements: Rock - Lotwil Veriatus; bracers, far west
  accept 713 -- Coolant Heads Prevail - Lotwil Veriatus; Frost Oil, from outside
  complete 713 -- Frost Oil for Lotwil Veriatus
  note Frost Oil has no Badlands source in the data (Hinterlands, Feralas and Felwood mobs at 0.02%) - bring one; the rest of this camp is local.
  turnin 713 -- Coolant Heads Prevail - the oil to Lotwil Veriatus
  accept 714 -- Gyro... What? - Lotwil Veriatus; a gyrochronatom, south-west

step West-south leg - bracers and the gyro buy

  zone map 1418

  tip The Greater Rock Elementals hold (0.93, 78.67) at the far west edge; Yuka Screwspigot (4.90, 94.70) sells at the south-west corner.
  complete 712 @0.93,78.67 era -- Bracers of Rock Binding off the Greater Rock Elementals, far west
  note The Gyrochronatom (714's objective) is vendor-sold: buy it from Yuka Screwspigot at (4.90, 94.70) on this leg.
  complete 714 @4.90,94.70 era -- the Gyrochronatom from Yuka Screwspigot, south-west

step West camp - Liquid, Bronze and the Hard triple

  zone map 1418

  tip Holding the bracers and the gyro: the Hard triple and the Liquid chain close at the camp; Fam'retor Guardian (26.01, 45.78) stands next door.
  turnin 712 -- Study of the Elements: Rock - the bracers to Lotwil Veriatus
  turnin 714 -- Gyro... What? - the gyrochronatom to Lotwil Veriatus
  accept 715 -- Liquid Stone - Lucien Tosselwrench; a Healing Potion and Lesser Invisibility, from outside
  complete 715 -- liquids for Lucien Tosselwrench
  note Neither liquid is Badlands-sourced in the data (Healing Potions from any alchemy supplier anywhere; Lesser Invisibility has no placed source at all) - bring both; the camp work stays local.
  turnin 715 -- Liquid Stone - the liquids to Lucien Tosselwrench
  accept 716 -- Stone Is Better than Cloth - Lucien Tosselwrench; Patterned Bronze Bracers, crafted
  complete 716 optional -- Patterned Bronze Bracers for Lucien Tosselwrench
  note The Patterned Bronze Bracers are a crafted Blacksmithing piece with no placed source - bring a pair or skip this turn-in; the route never wedges on it.
  turnin 716 optional -- Stone Is Better than Cloth - the bracers to Lucien Tosselwrench
  accept 734 -- This Is Going to Be Hard - Lotwil Veriatus; Lucien takes the word, in camp
  turnin 734 -- This Is Going to Be Hard - the word to Lucien Tosselwrench
  accept 777 -- This Is Going to Be Hard - Lucien Tosselwrench; Lotwil takes the word, in camp
  turnin 777 -- This Is Going to Be Hard - the word to Lotwil Veriatus
  accept 778 -- This Is Going to Be Hard - Lotwil Veriatus; Fam'retor's shackles, next door
  complete 778 @26.01,45.78 era -- Lotwil's Shackles off Fam'retor Guardian, next door
  turnin 778 -- This Is Going to Be Hard - the shackles to Lotwil Veriatus
  note The Craftsman's Writ: Frost Protection Potion (94256) starts from a writ item with no placed source - have it in your bags; Lotwil takes it, at 60.
  accept 94256 optional -- Craftsman's Writ: Frost Protection Potion - the writ; the potion to Lotwil, at 60
  turnin 94256 optional -- Craftsman's Writ: Frost Protection Potion - the potion to Lotwil Veriatus

step Center hub - Ryedol, Sigrun and Rigglefuzz

  zone map 1418

  tip Prospector Ryedol (53.42, 43.39) and Sigrun Ironhew (53.80, 43.30) hold the center; Rigglefuzz (42.39, 52.93) and Martek the Exiled (42.22, 52.69) work the west side; the Crumpled Map lies (53.03, 33.94) north of them and the Excavation Supply Crate (66.60, 22.00) north-east.
  accept 719 only Alliance -- A Dwarf and His Tools - Prospector Ryedol; Ryedol's pick, north-west
  complete 719 only Alliance @51.89,31.79 era -- Ryedol's Lucky Pick off the Shadowforge Tunnelers, north-west
  turnin 719 only Alliance -- A Dwarf and His Tools - the pick to Prospector Ryedol
  accept 720 only Alliance -- A Sign of Hope - the Crumpled Map; Ryedol reads it, south
  turnin 720 only Alliance -- A Sign of Hope - the map to Prospector Ryedol
  accept 721 only Alliance -- A Sign of Hope - Prospector Ryedol; Hammertoe takes the word, north-west
  accept 718 only Alliance -- Mirages - Sigrun Ironhew; the supply crate, north-east
  complete 718 only Alliance @66.60,22.00 era -- the Supply Crate from the excavation, north-east
  turnin 718 only Alliance -- Mirages - the crate back to Sigrun Ironhew
  accept 733 only Alliance -- Scrounging - Sigrun Ironhew; scrap from the Dustbelchers, east and west
  accept 703 -- Barbecued Buzzard Wings - Rigglefuzz; buzzard wings, center
  complete 703 @48.91,27.41 era -- Buzzard Wings off the Starving Buzzards, center
  turnin 703 -- Barbecued Buzzard Wings - the wings to Rigglefuzz
  accept 705 -- Pearl Diving - Rigglefuzz; Blue Pearls, from the coast
  complete 705 -- Blue Pearls for Rigglefuzz
  note Blue Pearls have no Badlands source in the data (Stranglethorn murlocs at under 1% and the Giant Clam there at 100%) - bring 9; the rest of this hub is local.
  turnin 705 -- Pearl Diving - the pearls to Rigglefuzz
  accept 2418 -- Power Stones - Rigglefuzz; Dentrium stones, north dig site
  note The Craftsman's Writ: Mageweave Bag (94304) starts from a writ item with no placed source - have it in your bags; Rigglefuzz takes it, at 60.
  accept 94304 optional -- Craftsman's Writ: Mageweave Bag - the writ; the bag to Rigglefuzz, at 60
  turnin 94304 optional -- Craftsman's Writ: Mageweave Bag - the bag to Rigglefuzz

